        "B. \\(Q = {b^{\\frac{4}{3}}}\\).",
        "C. \\(Q = {b^{\\frac{5}{9}}}\\).",
        "D. \\(Q = {b^2}\\)."
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "note": "\\(Q = {b^{\\frac{5}{3}}}:\\sqrt[3]{b} = {b^{\\frac{5}{3}}}:{b^{\\frac{1}{3}}} = {b^{\\frac{4}{3}}}\\)."
