      "note": "\\({\\left( {0,2} \\right)^{0,3}} = {\\left( {0,2} \\right)^{\\frac{3}{{10}}}} = {\\left[ {{{\\left( {0,2} \\right)}^3}} \\right]^{\\frac{1}{{10}}}} = {\\left( {0,008} \\right)^{\\frac{1}{{10}}}}\\). \\({\\left( {0,7} \\right)^{3,2}} = {\\left( {0,7} \\right)^{\\frac{{32}}{{10}}}} = {\\left[ {{{\\left( {0,7} \\right)}^{32}}} \\right]^{\\frac{1}{{10}}}}\\). \\({\\sqrt 3 ^{0,2}} = {\\left( 3 \\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}.\\frac{2}{{10}}}} = {3^{\\frac{1}{{10}}}}\\). Do \\({\\left( {0,7} \\right)^{32}} < 0,008 < 3\\) nên \\[{\\left( {0,7} \\right)^{3,2}} < {\\left( {0,2} \\right)^{0,3}} < {\\sqrt 3 ^{0,2}}\\]."
